{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviwall is a single-player survival game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 WALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free on the field, but with 4 walls surrounding the terrain, you'll feel trapped as you try to survive. Surviwall creates unique terrains in a limited area and challenges you to survive with limited resources. You must try to solve the mystery of the walls while trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/27c5aeb26b81eb28ca69b4f42f05dd10.poster.avif?t=1764233267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/27c5aeb26b81eb28ca69b4f42f05dd10.webm?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/27c5aeb26b81eb28ca69b4f42f05dd10.mp4?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIDFIELD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your luck, the islands that can appear from the midfield will provide you with an unlimited variety of resources to use and store. You may also have to deal with the invaders that come with the resources, so be prepared for anything! Surviwall aims to give you a different experience every time with its midfield mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/6b77dcfe55a26aab1efb62d18e9e799a.poster.avif?t=1764233267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/6b77dcfe55a26aab1efb62d18e9e799a.webm?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/6b77dcfe55a26aab1efb62d18e9e799a.mp4?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE FIELD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each new central area uniquely transforms your terrain, bringing fresh dynamism to the game. This means you'll need to adapt to different conditions and develop new strategies with every change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/72f297890d0a8f2133e077fa15c90ecb.poster.avif?t=1764233267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/72f297890d0a8f2133e077fa15c90ecb.webm?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/72f297890d0a8f2133e077fa15c90ecb.mp4?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARVEST &amp; PRODUCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build, upgrade and customize structures between 4 walls. New possibilities from the central area offer different building options. The map is randomized each time, but the buildings you build stay with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/f49d4456b6e4af9f734da8c01d7ed236.poster.avif?t=1764233267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/f49d4456b6e4af9f734da8c01d7ed236.webm?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/f49d4456b6e4af9f734da8c01d7ed236.mp4?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2749880?t=1764233267","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2749880?t=1764233267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/b6762459d684f9c3e10b73fba8ccc4aee8b8273d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764233267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/b6762459d684f9c3e10b73fba8ccc4aee8b8273d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764233267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviwall is a single-player survival game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 WALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free on the field, but with 4 walls surrounding the terrain, you'll feel trapped as you try to survive. Surviwall creates unique terrains in a limited area and challenges you to survive with limited resources. You must try to solve the mystery of the walls while trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/27c5aeb26b81eb28ca69b4f42f05dd10.poster.avif?t=1764233267\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/27c5aeb26b81eb28ca69b4f42f05dd10.webm?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/27c5aeb26b81eb28ca69b4f42f05dd10.mp4?t=1764233267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 